开萝尔:"他要我跟他一起去见系主任."
Carol: He asked me to go with him to meet the dean.

131
00:08:10,700 --> 00:08:13,400
麦琪:"哦,开萝尔宝贝,这太好了."
Maggie: Oh Carol honey. This is serious.

132
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:28,200
开萝尔:"是啊,所以,明天我能不能不出席和乌尔玛奶奶还有沃利一起的早午餐?除非你想让我疏远一个我们两个都认为是非常适合我的人."
Carol: Yeah. But it's tomorrow. So can I miss the brunch with Grandma Urma and Wally? Unless you want me to risk alienating a boy we both agree is...very right for me.

133
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:30,900
麦琪:"这事还得由你爸爸决定"
Maggie: Does this guilt stuff work with your dad?

134
00:08:30,900 --> 00:08:34,500
开萝尔:"好吧."
Carol: Like a charm.

135
00:08:34,500 --> 00:08:41,700
杰森:"我们要去一家很不错的餐厅吃一顿很美味的早午餐,吃东西时,绝对不能发出一点声响."
Jason: We were having a nice brunch at a nice restaurant and we were eating. That noise was totally inappropriate.

136
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:44,500
本:"可是在某些国家,这代表最高的赞赏."
Ben: Well in some countries it's considered the highest compliment.

137
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:47,700
麦克:"是吗,找出那是哪里,然后去那里吧."
Mike: Yeah, well find out where and go there.

138
00:08:47,700 --> 00:08:48,500
本:"沃利笑了."
Ben: Wally laughed.

139
00:08:48,500 --> 00:08:50,100
杰森:"没错,那是因为沃利……"
Jason: Yeah, well that's because Wally's...

140
00:08:50,100 --> 00:08:52,200
麦琪:"不久就会是你的继父了."
Maggie: Going to be your step grandfather very soon.

141
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,800
开萝尔:"谁也不许动电话."
Carol: Don't anybody touch that phone.

142
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:55,200
杰森:"开萝尔,你在这里干什么?"
Jason: Carol, what are you doing here?

143
00:08:55,200 --> 00:09:04,200
开萝尔:"是这样的,山迪已经迟到两个半小时了.都是你们唠唠叨叨的,自从你们离开这房子以后,它就一次没响过,现在你们满意了吧?"
Carol: Alright, Sandy is two and a half hours late. Must you rub it in. That phone has not rung once since you left the house. Are you happy now?

144
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:08,300
本:"哦,等我去拿摄象机."
Ben: Oooh. Let me go get the camera.

145
00:09:08,300 --> 00:09:14,600
麦克:"那么,开萝尔,有留言吗?"
Mike: So. Carol. Any messages?

146
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,400
麦琪:"麦克."
Maggie: Mike.

147
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:17,700
麦克:"嘿,如果我不那么说,就不是我了."
Mike: Hey, if I didn't say that, it wouldn't have been me.

148
00:09:17,700 --> 00:09:22,400
开萝尔:"我没事的,好了,有没有可能是我们家的电话坏了?"
Carol: And I would have been fine. Alright, is there any chance that the phone might be broken?

149
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,100
杰森:"我可不这么想,不过我可以叫电话公司的人来检查一下."
Jason: I don't think so. I can call the phone company and check.

150
00:09:24,100 --> 00:09:27,000
开萝尔:"不行,山迪可能会打来,那就一直占线了."
Carol: No. Sandy might call and get a busy signal.

151
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,700
杰森:"宝贝,我们有呼叫等待啊."
Jason: Honey, we have call waiting.

152
00:09:28,700 --> 00:09:32,100
开萝尔:"如果电话坏了就不行了啊."
Carol: Well not if the phone is broken.

153
00:09:32,100 --> 00:09:35,800
杰森:"如果我不打电话就不知道它到底有没有坏掉啊."
Jason: And we won't find out if I don't call.

154
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:38,600
开萝尔:"为什么你们就是不能放过我?"
Carol: Why are these men tormenting me?

155
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,400
麦琪:"杰森."
Maggie: Jason.

156
00:09:39,400 --> 00:09:52,000
杰森:"什么,我只是……好吧,过来,麦克.我说你和我都应该到起居室去.这样对大家都好,尤其是对火气这么大的每一个人来说."
Jason: What, I just... Alright. Come on Mike. I say you and I ought to head on into the living room. Think that's the best idea for everybody. Especially everybody wearing boxer shorts.

157
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,700
麦克:"爸爸,他们都疯了吗?"
Mike: Dad, are they all crazy?

158
00:09:53,700 --> 00:09:57,500
杰森:"我告诉你……没有!"
Jason: I'll tell you...No!

159
00:09:57,500 --> 00:10:11,700
开萝尔:"我知道山迪为什么没有打电话了,我是说,他昨天本来不是想把我称呼为他的女朋友,他只是简单地想戏弄我一下.好吧,我不会饶他的,等他打电话来的时候,如果他打来的话,我才不要跟他说话.就是这样."
Carol: I know why sandy hasn't called. I mean, he just didn't mean to call me his girlfriend yesterday and he's trying to figure out an easy way to let me down. Well, I'll show him. When he calls, if he calls, I'll refuse to talk to him. That's wine.

160
00:10:11,700 --> 00:10:14,000
(电话响了.)
(Phone rings)

161
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:16,900
开萝尔:"喂,山迪,山迪!"
Carol: Hello Sandy. Sandy!

162
00:10:16,900 --> 00:10:20,600
本:"开萝尔,看这里,打来了?"
Ben: Carol, over here. Looking for this?

163
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,400
开萝尔:"本!"
Carol: Ben!

164
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:29,600
麦琪:"本,够了,开萝尔,你到起居室接电话好了."
Maggie: Ben, that's enough. Carol why don't you pick up the call in the living room.

165
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,300
开萝尔:"嘿!"
Carol: Hey!

166
00:10:31,300 --> 00:10:35,400
麦克:"打来了?"
Mike: Looking for this?

167
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:36,800
开萝尔:"是啊."
Carol: Yeah.

168
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:37,600
麦克:"要说什么甜言蜜语?"
Mike: What's the magic word?

169
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,500
开萝尔:"麦克!"
Carol: Mike!

170
00:10:38,500 --> 00:10:40,600
麦克:"就是这个."
Mike: That's it.

171
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,100
本:"干得好,麦克."
Ben: Great stuff Mike.

172
00:10:42,100 --> 00:11:15,000
开萝尔:"喂,山迪,达格,什么?山迪伤得严重吗?真的吗?好的,知道了.是山迪的室友,山迪昨晚出车祸了,而且伤得非常严重."
Carol: Hello Sandy. Dugg. What? How bad is Sandy hurt? Really. Yeah. Ok. That was Sandy's room mate. Sandy was in a car accident last night and hurt really bad.

173
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:23,400
(在医院里)
(At the hospital)

174
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:24,300
开萝尔:"达格."
Carol: Dug!

175
00:11:24,300 --> 00:11:25,100
达格:"开萝尔."
Dugg: Carol.

176
00:11:25,100 --> 00:11:26,700
开萝尔:"山迪怎么样了?"
Carol: How is he?

177
00:11:26,700 --> 00:11:41,700
达格:"恩,这里的医生说他状况不太好,但是,我不太明白,我是说他看上去没什么.哦,当然了,他全身都包着纱布,还有别的什么,但是我们刚刚还在聊天,甚至开玩笑.他说我看上去比他还要糟糕,或许确实如此,我是说,就像山迪说的,至少他还睡了一觉,你瞧,说实话,从凌晨三点我就一直在这里,我都喝了15杯咖啡了.你们是开萝尔的父母?"
Dugg: Well this doc said he's not out of the woods yet, but I don't get it. I mean he seems ok to me. Oh sure, he's banged up and everything, but we were just talking, even joking. He said that I look worse than he does. Probably do. I mean like Sandy said, at least he got some sleep last night. Look, I'll be honest with you. I've been here since three am. I've had fifteen cups of coffee. Are you Carol's parents?

178
00:11:41,700 --> 00:11:44,100
麦琪:"是的,我是麦琪西佛尔."
Maggie: Yes. Maggie Seaver.

179
00:11:44,100 --> 00:11:44,800
达格:"嗨."
Dugg: Hi.

180
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:45,900
杰森:"我是杰森西佛尔."
Jason: Jason Seaver.

181
00:11:45,900 --> 00:11:47,600
达格:"嗨,我是达格沃利特.山迪的室友,见到你们很高兴."
Dugg: Hi. Dugg Wallet. Sandy's room mate. Nice to meet you.

182
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:49,200
杰森:"我也是,我去看看能帮点什么忙."
Jason: Yeah. I'll see what I can find out.

183
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:51,000
开萝尔:"我爸爸是医生."
Carol: My dad's a doctor.

184
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,000
麦琪:"他家人在这儿吗?"
Maggie: Are his family here?

185
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:56,000
达格:"没有,他家里人都出城了,我告诉他爸爸了,他说他们马上飞回来,大概今晚就会到."
Dugg: No, no. His folks are out of town. I talked to his dad. He said they're flying back and supposed to be here tonight.

186
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,000
开萝尔:"我能去看看他吗?"
Carol: Can I see him?

187
00:11:57,000 --> 00:12:10,900
达格:"也许吧,碰碰运气吧,开萝尔,因为医院只允许亲属进加护病房.我跟一个看上去特别像莱瑞巴德梅勒姆的护士说,恩,说我是山迪的弟弟,你就告诉她说你是山迪的妹妹好了.好吧,我去跟她说点好话,除了我,谁还想要咖啡?"
Dugg: Maybe, if you play your cards right. Carol, see they only let relatives in to intensive care. I told this nurse, who by the way looks exactly like Larry Bud Melmum, that uh, I was Sandy's brother, so you could just tell her you're his sister. Alright, I'll go get her. Anyone beside me need some coffee?

188
00:12:10,900 --> 00:12:14,400
麦琪:"我想你还应该吃点东西,达格."
Maggie: I think you should get some food too Dugg.

189
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:16,600
达格:"吃的,好主意."
Dugg: Food. Great idea.

190
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:23,000
开萝尔:"妈妈,我还是不能相信会发生这样的事,我是说山迪一定会没事的,他会的."
Carol: I still can't believe this is happening mum. I mean Sandy's going to be ok. He's got to.

191
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:24,800
麦琪:"我们要往好的方面想,甜心."
Maggie: We will all think good thoughts sweetheart.

192
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:29,200
开萝尔:"他今天也没去成系主任的午餐会,他肯定很沮丧."
Carol: He missed the Dean's luncheon today. He's really going to be upset.

193
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:31,900
杰森:"他们告诉我现在山迪的血红蛋白很稳定."
Jason: They tell me Sandy's hemoglobin is stable at this point.

194
00:12:31,900 --> 00:12:32,900
麦琪:"这是什么意思?"
Maggie: What does that mean?

195
00:12:32,900 --> 00:12:36,700
杰森:"恩,就是说他现在没有大碍."
Jason: Well, that means he's alright for now.

196
00:12:36,700 --> 00:12:40,600
麦琪:"宝贝,有时朋友的关怀胜过任何药物,对吗,杰森?"
Maggie: Honey, sometimes a friendly face can do more good than any medicine can. Right Jason?

197
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:43,400
杰森:"没错."
Jason: Right.

198
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:47,400
护士:"你们的朋友,咖啡先生,跟我说这里有人想看看山迪加里森."
Nurse: You're friend, Mr. Coffee, tells me someone's here to see Sandy Calison.

199
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:51,700
开萝尔:"是的,是我,我是他妹妹,这是我的父母,他们能担保."
Carol: Yes, I am. I'm his sister, these are my parents and they'll vouch for me.

200
00:12:51,700 --> 00:12:53,400
护士:"那么你们是山迪的父母."
Nurse: So, you're Sandy's parents.

201
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:57,600
开萝尔:"不,哦,好吧,我不善于撒谎."
Carol: No. Oh. Alright, I'm not very good at lying.

202
00:12:57,600 --> 00:13:00,800
护士:"我们只允许直系亲属探视."
Nurse: We restrict visitors to immediate family.

203
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:02,800
开萝尔:"我是他未婚妻."
Carol: I'm his fiance.

204
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:03,700
杰森:"未婚妻!"
Jason: Fiance!

205
00:13:03,700 --> 00:13:05,200
开萝尔:"是真的."
Carol: It's true.

206
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:06,600
麦琪:"她说的是真的."
Maggie: She's not lying.

207
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:07,500
杰森:"你完全可以相信我们."
Jason: You have our word.

208
00:13:07,500 --> 00:13:09,300
护士:"那你们是她的父母?"
Nurse: You're still her parents?

209
00:13:09,300 --> 00:13:12,700
杰森:"是的."
Jason: I think so.

210
00:13:12,700 --> 00:13:17,800
麦琪:"你瞧,如果我们女儿订婚了,我们肯定会知道的,对吧?"
Maggie: Look, we ought to know if our daughter is engaged.

211
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:33,500
护士:"跟我来吧,记着,不能太久."
Nurse: Follow me. Now remember, this has to be quick.

212
00:13:33,500 --> 00:13:34,700
开萝尔:"山迪."
Carol: Sandy.

213
00:13:34,700 --> 00:13:36,400
山迪:"开萝尔."
Sandy: Carol.

214
00:13:36,400 --> 00:13:37,600
开萝尔:"嗨."
Carol: Hi.

215
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:42,700
山迪:"嗨,原谅我,我现在没法起来."
Sandy: Hi. You'll forgive me if I don't get up.

216
00:13:42,700 --> 00:13:44,300
开萝尔:"恩,你看上去并不太糟."
Carol: Well, you don't look so bad.

217
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:52,500
山迪:"是啊,说实话,我感觉不太好,身上有这么多的管子和线,我像是在拍电影了."
Sandy: Well, to tell you the truth I don't feel so hot. I got so many tubes and wires in me. I got HBO now.

218
00:13:52,500 --> 00:13:55,400
开萝尔:"身上很疼吗?"
Carol: Are you in a lot of pain?

219
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:58,300
山迪:"等我爸爸过来的时候会更疼的."
Sandy: Not as much as I'm going to be in when my dad gets here.

220
00:13:58,300 --> 00:14:01,400
开萝尔:"山迪,你发生这样的事我真的很心疼."
Carol: Sandy, I am so sorry this happened to you.

221
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:07,400
山迪:"开萝尔,不用担心,我会好起来的,可我的车就不行了,那才是该担心的."
Sandy: Carol, don't worry. I'm going to be ok. My car on the other hand, that's who you should worry about.

222
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:08,900
开萝尔:"昨晚发生了什么事情?"
Carol: What happened last night?

223
00:14:08,900 --> 00:14:18,500
山迪:"恩,我冲着一棵树就撞过去了,我会因为酒后驾驶而被起诉的."
Sandy: Well this big tree ran right out in front of me. And I'm going to be charged with drink driving.

224
00:14:18,500 --> 00:14:21,700
开萝尔:"可是我不明白,我是说我们喝得也不多啊."
Carol: But I don't understand. I mean it's not like we had that much to drink.

225
00:14:21,700 --> 00:14:30,500
山迪:"我知道,我是说我有好多次比昨晚喝得多多了,也没发生什么意外.我想昨晚可能是运气不好."
Sandy: I know. I mean there've been plenty of times I've put away a lot more than that, and nothing happened. I guess I just ran out of luck last night.

226
00:14:30,500 --> 00:14:51,200
开萝尔:"你开玩笑的吗?我是说想想发生的这一切吧,你已经相当幸运了.只是撞坏一辆车而已,重要的是你没有什么大碍.你还有第二次机会,你再也不会做这样的事了吧,对吧?"
Carol: Are you kidding? I mean when you think of what could have happened. You were really lucky. So you lost a car. The important thing is that you are going to be alright. You got a second chance now and you are never going to do anything like that again. Right?

227
00:14:51,200 --> 00:15:00,400
山迪:"对,听着,我爸爸过来的时候你能跟他谈谈吗?我是说你或许可以让他再给我买辆车."
Sandy: Right. Listen, could you do the talking when my dad gets here? I mean you could probably get me a new car.

228
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:02,700
开萝尔:"医生说你还要在医院待多久?"
Carol: So how long do they say they are going to keep you here?

229
00:15:02,700 --> 00:15:09,400
山迪:"我不知道,护士说内伤相当的麻烦,你不觉得她看起来有点……"
Sandy: I don't know. The nurse says these internal injuries can be pretty tricky. Don't you think she looks a little like..?

230
00:15:09,400 --> 00:15:35,800
开萝尔:"有点像莱瑞簿德梅勒姆,是的,山迪,你知道吗?直到我听说你受伤住院的时候,我才知道我有多喜欢你.或许这就是它发生的原因.我是说,人们常说万物都有其缘由.是的,我是说或许这场车祸对我们两个来说是件好事,听上去很蠢,是吗?"
Carol: Larry Bud Milmen. Yeah. You know Sandy, I didn't know how much I liked you until I found out you were hurt. Maybe that's why it happened. I mean they say everything happens for a reason. Right. I mean maybe this accident was a good thing for both of us. Sounds dumb, doesn't it?

231
00:15:35,800 --> 00:15:47,500
山迪:"不,但是如果你现在发现我没事的话,你还会这么喜欢我吗,开萝尔?"
Sandy: No. But now that you've found out that I'm going to be ok, do you like me any less? Carol.

232
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:50,100
开萝尔:"让我想想."
Carol: I'm thinking.

233
00:15:50,100 --> 00:15:56,200
山迪:"你以前吻过鼻子里插着输氧管的人吗?"
Sandy: So, have you ever kissed a guy with tubes up his nose before?

234
00:15:56,200 --> 00:16:04,200
开萝尔:"鼻子里面,没有."
Carol: Up his nose, no.

235
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:09,600
山迪:"当心,机器在监控我的心率."
Sandy: Careful, they are monitoring my heart rate.

236
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:11,100
开萝尔:"我能帮你点什么?"
Carol: Can I get you anything?

237
00:16:11,100 --> 00:16:12,700
山迪:"我想来瓶啤酒."
Sandy: I wouldn't mind a beer.

238
00:16:12,700 --> 00:16:14,400
开萝尔:"天啊!你怎么能……"
Carol: What! How can you...

239
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:22,700
山迪:"开萝尔,这只是个玩笑.相信我,我能再弯弯手肘都是很久以后的事情了."
Sandy: Carol. That was a joke. Believe me, it's going to be a long time before I bend my elbow again.

240
00:16:22,700 --> 00:16:25,800
开萝尔:"显然,哈哈哈."
Carol: Obviously. Ha ha ha.

241
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:29,500
山迪:"开萝尔,请让你的男朋友也笑笑吧."
Sandy: Carol, let your boyfriend get the laughs. Please.

242
00:16:29,500 --> 00:16:37,000
开萝尔:"好的,你的女朋友会安安静静地在这里坐着."
Carol: Ok. Your girlfriend will just sit here and be quiet.

243
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:39,000
护士:"小姐,探视结束了."
Nurse: Miss. You'll have to go.

244
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:39,700
开萝尔:"再等……"
Carol: Just one...

245
00:16:39,700 --> 00:16:41,600
护士:"我不管他是不是你的未婚夫."
Nurse: I don't care if he is your fiance?

246
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:42,500
山迪:"未婚夫!"
Sandy: Fiance!

247
00:16:42,500 --> 00:16:55,500
开萝尔:"哦,是的,我只有那么说他们才会让我进来见你,那不是谎话,不过也不是事实."
Carol: Oh yeah. That's what I said so they'd let me in to see you. Not that it's a lie. Or the truth either.

248
00:16:55,500 --> 00:16:57,400
杰森:"我恨医院."
Jason: I hate hospitals.

249
00:16:57,400 --> 00:16:59,100
麦琪:"杰森,你自己也是医生啊."
Maggie: Jason, you are a doctor.

250
00:16:59,100 --> 00:17:09,200
杰森:"我知道,小点声,别告诉开萝尔这个,不过我真的是喜欢山迪."
Jason: I know. Keep it quiet. Don't tell Carol this, but I really like Sandy.

251
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:18,900
麦琪:"杰森,我真是太喜欢你了."
Maggie: Jason, I really like you.

252
00:17:18,900 --> 00:17:23,200
杰森:"这是每个家长的噩梦,不是吗?"
Jason: Every parent's nightmare isn't it?

253
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:34,000
麦琪:"你知道吗,你生活在你自己的小世界里,一切看上去都那么安全,但是我想外面也许……"
Maggie: You know, you live in your own little world, and everything seems so safe. But I guess right outside, there's always...

254
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:38,900
杰森:"麻烦已经已经够多了,开萝尔."
Jason: There's plenty of it too. Carol.

255
00:17:38,900 --> 00:17:40,100
麦琪:"怎么样呢?"
Maggie: Well?

256
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:47,000
开萝尔:"他没什么事,看上去不错,他一直在笑,还跟我开玩笑,我肯定他很快就会康复的."
Carol: He's feeling great. He looked good. He was laughing and making jokes. I'm sure he's going to be fine.

257
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:47,900
麦琪:"谢天谢地."
Maggie: Thank goodness.

258
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:49,700
开萝尔:"是啊."
Carol: You said it.

259
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:50,900
杰森:"他告诉你到底是怎么回事了吗?"
Jason: Did he tell you how it happened?

260
00:17:50,900 --> 00:17:52,200
开萝尔:"车祸怎么发生的?"
Carol: How what happened?

261
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,600
杰森:"车祸,开萝尔?"
Jason: The accident Carol.

262
00:17:53,600 --> 00:17:55,800
开萝尔:"怎么了?"
Carol: What's going on?

263
00:17:55,800 --> 00:18:02,100
开萝尔:"好吧,我也可以告诉你们,不管怎样,你们还是会通过警察知道一切的."
Carol: Ok, I might as well tell you. You'll find out anyway with the police and everything.

264
00:18:02,100 --> 00:18:02,800
杰森:"警察?"
Jason: The police?

265
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:07,600
麦琪:"到底发生什么事?"
Maggie: What happened?

266
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:10,400
开萝尔:"昨晚,山迪跟我去了一个地方."
Carol: Last night Sandy and I went to a place.

267
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:11,800
麦琪:"什么地方?"
Maggie: A place?

268
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:15,500
开萝尔:"就是供应酒水的餐厅."
Carol: Kind of a restaurant that serves drinks.

269
00:18:15,500 --> 00:18:16,700
杰森:"酒吧?"
Jason: A bar?

270
00:18:16,700 --> 00:18:19,600
开萝尔:"没错."
Carol: That's it.

271
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:21,800
杰森:"你喝酒了?"
Jason: Were you drinking?

272
00:18:21,800 --> 00:18:22,500
开萝尔:"对."
Carol: Yes.

273
00:18:22,500 --> 00:18:23,400
麦琪:"山迪也喝了?"
Maggie: Was Sandy?

274
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:27,800
开萝尔:"对,他还开着车."
Carol: Yes. And driving.

275
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:29,700
麦琪:"开萝尔,我们之前说过."
Maggie: Carol, we have talked about this.

276
00:18:29,700 --> 00:18:30,700
开萝尔:"妈妈."
Carol: Mum.

277
00:18:30,700 --> 00:18:36,000
杰森:"我真不敢相信我所听到的,开萝尔.我是说,我以为你足够理智,不会坐那样一个人的车."
Jason: I don't believe what I'm hearing Carol. I mean I thought you had more sense than to get into a car with a guy like that.

278
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:36,500
开萝尔:"我确实是这么做的."
Carol: I do.

279
00:18:36,500 --> 00:18:38,300
杰森:"我可不想听到这些."
Jason: Well it doesn't sound like that to me.

280
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:46,700
开萝尔:"好了,爸爸,别这么生气了,我们知道做错了,我们已经吸取教训了.现在山迪得到第二次机会,他以后再也不会这么做了."
Carol: Well dad. You don't have to get mad. We know it was wrong. We've learned our lesson. Sandy's got a second chance now and he's never going to do it again.

281
00:18:46,700 --> 00:18:47,400
杰森:"但是……"
Jason: But right...

282
00:18:47,400 --> 00:18:52,700
开萝尔:"而且我也再不会这么做了."
Carol: And I'm never going to do it again either.

283
00:18:52,700 --> 00:19:04,400
杰森:"开萝尔,你瞧,宝贝,我非常爱你,我只是非常地关心你."
Jason: Carol look. Honey, I love you so much. The idea of you lying in there.

284
00:19:04,400 --> 00:19:07,100
开萝尔:"爸爸."
Carol: Dad.

285
00:19:07,100 --> 00:19:13,200
达格:"我几乎把整个小卖部都买来了,我们现在有金枪鱼,鸡蛋沙拉,核桃派,我还买了苹果和香蕉."
Dugg: I bought the entire cafeteria. We're talking liver, tuna, egg salad, pecan pie, I got some apples and some bananas.

286
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:29,000
护士(踩在香蕉上滑倒了):"啊!"
Nurse: (slips on banana) Ahhhh!

287
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:35,000
达格:"在医院里真好,恩?你看,没摔着骨头吧,恩?"
Dugg: It's a good thing we're in a hospital. Hu? Look, you haven't broken anything have you?

288
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:37,800
护士:"还没有."
Nurse: Not yet.

289
00:19:37,800 --> 00:19:39,800
达格:"哦!"
Dugg: Och!

290
00:19:39,800 --> 00:19:41,600
麦琪:"那么山迪父母6点左右会到吗?"
Maggie: So Sandy's parents are going to be in around six?

291
00:19:41,600 --> 00:19:47,000
开萝尔:"是的,我7点再回医院去,山迪说一个小时也够他爸爸喊叫一通了."
Carol: Yeah. I'm going to go back to the hospital at seven. Sandy thinks an hour should be enough time for his dad to stop yelling.

292
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:54,700
杰森:"作为家长,开萝尔,我想说最少要两个小时,你最好8点钟再去."
Jason: Speaking as a parent Carol, I'd say two hours as a minimum. Better make it eight o'clock.

293
00:19:54,700 --> 00:19:55,400
麦琪:"嗨,麦克."
Maggie: Hi Mike.

294
00:19:55,400 --> 00:20:06,500
麦克:"嗨,啊,听着,开萝尔,刚才达格从医院打电话来了."
Mike: Hi. Ah, listen Carol. That guy Dugg just called from the hospital.

295
00:20:06,500 --> 00:20:09,000
开萝尔:"唔."
Carol: Uh hu.

296
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:12,400
麦克:"恩,他告诉我,恩,他说……"
Mike: Well he told me that uh, he said that...

297
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:17,500
杰森:"怎么回事,麦克?"
Jason: What is it Mike?

298
00:20:17,500 --> 00:20:23,900
麦克:"开萝尔,山迪刚刚死掉了."
Mike: Carol, Sandy just died.

299
00:20:23,900 --> 00:20:24,500
麦琪:"哦,我的天啊!"
Maggie: Oh my god.

300
00:20:24,500 --> 00:20:27,500
麦克:"是的,几分钟之前他刚说的."
Mike: Yeah, he said it was just a few minutes ago.

301
00:20:27,500 --> 00:20:34,600
开萝尔:"麦克尔西佛尔,这是我听过的最差劲的玩笑,我永远不会原谅你的."
Carol: Michael Seaver, that is the sickest joke that I have ever heard and I am never going to forgive you.

302
00:20:34,600 --> 00:20:36,600
麦克:"开萝尔,我……"
Mike: Carol, I...

303
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:50,800
开萝尔:"那是根本不可能的事情,我是说我们刚刚还在一起,我看到他的,他看上去一点事情也没有,他笑嘻嘻的,还跟我开玩笑,说很后悔发生这样的事情,他才不会死呢."
Carol: But that's impossible. I mean we were just down there. I saw him, he looked good. He was laughing and joking and sorry that this happened. He wouldn't dare die.

304
00:20:50,800 --> 00:20:51,700
麦琪:"亲爱的."
Maggie: Honey.

305
00:20:51,700 --> 00:20:52,400
开萝尔:"不会的!"
Carol: No!

306
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:58,500
麦克:"嘿,医生说他刚刚,恩,身体内部出血,或者是别的什么,对了,是叫内出血."
Mike: Hey the doctors said that he was just um, bleeding inside or something. Internal hemorrhaging.

307
00:20:58,500 --> 00:21:05,600
开萝尔:"妈妈,肯定是弄错了.我是说,山迪马上会康复的,是他跟我说的."
Carol: Mum, this has to be some mistake. I mean Sandy's going to be fine. He told me.

308
00:21:05,600 --> 00:21:11,100
麦琪:"亲爱的."
开萝尔:"这不公平,为什么他没有第二次机会?为什么没有?"
00:21:11,100
Maggie: Honey. Carol: This isn't fair. What happened to his second chance? What happened to his second chance?
